      "message": "In this CL, low complexity decode mode speed features of vertical 608p/720p resolutions are extended to vertical 1080p resolution. We have tested this CL and its parent [CL](https://aomedia-review.googlesource.com/c/aom/+/203901) on commit 2a70ad7b (dated 26 Sept). We validated that both patches don\u0027t conflict with the latest version.\n\nThe performance results of vertical 1080p clips with low complexity decode mode enabled (excluding the impact of sf `adaptive_luma_loop_filter_skip`) are given below:\n```\nInstruction Count                                                                 \n                           Reduction(%)                        BD-Rate Loss(%)                  Time Reduction(%)\ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder    avg.psnr   ovr.psnr    ssim      vmaf    vmaf_neg    dav1d Decoder   \n   1         1080p        3.585    28.440     1.4448     1.4661    2.4117    1.2980    1.1123       23.029\n   2         1080p        6.089    26.522     1.3926     1.4398    2.3676    1.3641    1.1507       21.487\n   3         1080p        4.272    26.728     1.6171     1.6747    2.6629    1.7533    1.5080       21.85537\n\n```\nThe performance results of vertical 1080p clips with low complexity decode enabled w.r.t lc-dec\u003d0 are given below. This comparison includes the impact of `adaptive_luma_loop_filter_skip` which was enabled by default for all vertical resolutions.\n```\n                        Instruction Count                                                                 \n                           Reduction(%)                        BD-Rate Loss(%)                  Time Reduction(%)\ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder    avg.psnr   ovr.psnr    ssim      vmaf    vmaf_neg    dav1d Decoder   \n   1         1080p       3.522     30.181     1.4977     1.5235    2.4578    1.3090    1.1218       24.652\n   2         1080p       6.119     28.437     1.4506     1.4923    2.3783    1.3204    1.1156       23.249\n   3         1080p       4.251     28.115     1.6587     1.7175    2.7120    1.7676    1.5220       23.103\n```\nPlease review the CL.",
